        {
          "text": "“Aso do inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Koany, etusurupi imakakinikus, luimejaata aijar kwape akweny, anyilununei kakaninikus; aosikini aijar, aijar naka nul kaluimejaete kwape akweny. ",
          "type": "text",
